So, I'm not saying to completely remove deduplication, just that you only need to deduplicate based on the current command. Concretely the following code
```
std::vector<hstring> deduped{};
deduped.reserve(...);
deduped.emplace_back(command);

for (const auto& r : recentCommands){
    if (r != command) { deduped.emplace_back(r); }
}

```
